Found while comparing DesignCraft with the PDF InDesign made of Learn Skills Daily's long-document exercise (*InDesign Full Course Tutorial*, [video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BuE8JpajmgY); the course's `03_HP_LongDoc_Class` package includes InDesign's IDML and PDF).

Refreshed against main `443ea464` on 2026-10-19. Merge conflicts resolved while preserving the PR’s behavior and newer upstream changes.

Validation: every refreshed branch passes `cargo check --workspace --all-targets` independently. The combined set passes formatting, strict workspace Clippy, PDF dependencies, assets, layers and WASM. After the full workspace native run, the final corrections were revalidated with the complete engine, tools and UI library suites, including all six affected regression tests. Only these documented Windows baseline failures remain: cmd::interchange::tests::only_local_graphic_files_are_read_from_links, cmd::links::tests::eps_relink_update_and_folder_relink_retain_source, cmd::package::tests::package_refuses_windows_directory_redirects, cmd::preflight::placed_vector_tests::a_missing_link_shown_by_its_preview_is_still_reported. No tests were disabled. Runtime validation was combined, not a separate full-suite run per branch.

On page 11 there's a two-column frame with these elements, top to bottom:
- a sidebar paragraph spanning both columns;
- the heading "Campanula Speciosa" (Keep with Next 1);
- a picture with a 15 pt text wrap over the left column, right under the heading;
